  "title": "Mom's Ham and Bean Soup",
  "description": "This ham and bean soup recipe is made with Great Northern beans and meaty ham hocks for a comforting, made-from-scratch meal perfect for cold days.",
  "authors": [
    "BIGLERMOM"
  ],
